{"type":"message","id":"8225620f","parentId":"13c70858","timestamp":"2026-01-31T22:01:42.116Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_0166dhxwp7BBd61aC8PFog9G","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"monitor.js\npaper-trader.js\nscan-whales.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  apps: [\n    {\n      name: 'polymarket-monitor',\n      script: 'src/monitor.js',\n      cwd: '/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade',\n      watch: false,\n      autorestart: true,\n      max_restarts: 10,\n      restart_delay: 30000,\n      env: {\n        NODE_PATH: '/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade/node_modules'\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      name: 'polymarket-paper',\n      script: 'src/paper-trader.js',\n      cwd: '/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade',\n      watch: false,\n      autorestart: true,\n      max_restarts: 10,\n      restart_delay: 30000,\n      env: {\n        NODE_PATH: '/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade/node_modules'\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n};\n{\n  \"name\": \"polymarket-copytrade\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Polymarket whale wallet monitor and copy-trading system\",\n  \"main\": \"src/monitor.js\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"monitor\": \"node src/monitor.js\",\n    \"scan\": \"node src/scan-whales.js\",\n    \"test\": \"node src/test-api.js\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"node-fetch\": \"^2.7.0\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":32,"aggregated":"monitor.js\npaper-trader.js\nscan-whales.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  apps: [\n    {\n      name: 'polymarket-monitor',\n      script: 'src/monitor.js',\n      cwd: '/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade',\n      watch: false,\n      autorestart: true,\n      max_restarts: 10,\n      restart_delay: 30000,\n      env: {\n        NODE_PATH: '/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade/node_modules'\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      name: 'polymarket-paper',\n      script: 'src/paper-trader.js',\n      cwd: '/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade',\n      watch: false,\n      autorestart: true,\n      max_restarts: 10,\n      restart_delay: 30000,\n      env: {\n        NODE_PATH: '/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade/node_modules'\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n};\n{\n  \"name\": \"polymarket-copytrade\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Polymarket whale wallet monitor and copy-trading system\",\n  \"main\": \"src/monitor.js\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"monitor\": \"node src/monitor.js\",\n    \"scan\": \"node src/scan-whales.js\",\n    \"test\": \"node src/test-api.js\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"node-fetch\": \"^2.7.0\"\n  }\n}","cwd":"/home/ec2-user/clawd"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1769896902103}}
{"type":"message","id":"03bf2d69","parentId":"8225620f","timestamp":"2026-01-31T22:01:42.134Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01KMpZhqCsBhHVjxbH2x8Sbn","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Polymarket Copy-Trading — Current State\n\n**Last updated:** 2026-01-31\n\n## What's Built\n- Whale monitor scanning every 5 min (PM2: polymarket-monitor)\n- Paper trader with $100 simulated portfolio (PM2: polymarket-paper)\n- 9 whale wallets loaded: Theo4, Fredi9999, Len9311238, zxgngl, RepTrump, PrincessCaro, walletmobile, BetTom42, 432614799197\n- One-pager strategy doc at docs/ONE-PAGER.md\n- Risk framework: 5% max per trade, 25% max exposure, 30% stop-loss\n- Whale activity logged to data/whale-activity.jsonl\n- Portfolio state at data/paper-portfolio.json\n- Heartbeat check configured for whale trade alerts to Doug on Telegram\n\n## What's NOT Working\n- Whale PnL/win rate stats not populated (client-side rendered on polymarketanalytics.com)\n- No real money trading yet (need Polymarket wallet + API creds)\n- No automated Telegram alerting yet (relies on heartbeat check)\n\n## Next Steps\n- [ ] Paper trade over the weekend, collect data\n- [ ] Backfill whale stats (PnL, win rates) \n- [ ] Doug sets up Polymarket wallet when ready to go live\n- [ ] Build portfolio report (daily summary to Telegram)\n- [ ] Add to dashboard\n\n## Key Files\n- `src/monitor.js` — continuous whale scanner\n- `src/paper-trader.js` — simulated portfolio tracker\n- `src/scan-whales.js` — one-shot scanner with market overview\n- `data/whales.json` — tracked wallet addresses\n- `data/paper-portfolio.json` — current portfolio state\n- `ecosystem.config.cjs` — PM2 config for both processes\n---\nmonitor-state.json\npaper-portfolio.json\npaper-state.json\nwhales.json"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":31,"aggregated":"# Polymarket Copy-Trading — Current State\n\n**Last updated:** 2026-01-31\n\n## What's Built\n- Whale monitor scanning every 5 min (PM2: polymarket-monitor)\n- Paper trader with $100 simulated portfolio (PM2: polymarket-paper)\n- 9 whale wallets loaded: Theo4, Fredi9999, Len9311238, zxgngl, RepTrump, PrincessCaro, walletmobile, BetTom42, 432614799197\n- One-pager strategy doc at docs/ONE-PAGER.md\n- Risk framework: 5% max per trade, 25% max exposure, 30% stop-loss\n- Whale activity logged to data/whale-activity.jsonl\n- Portfolio state at data/paper-portfolio.json\n- Heartbeat check configured for whale trade alerts to Doug on Telegram\n\n## What's NOT Working\n- Whale PnL/win rate stats not populated (client-side rendered on polymarketanalytics.com)\n- No real money trading yet (need Polymarket wallet + API creds)\n- No automated Telegram alerting yet (relies on heartbeat check)\n\n## Next Steps\n- [ ] Paper trade over the weekend, collect data\n- [ ] Backfill whale stats (PnL, win rates) \n- [ ] Doug sets up Polymarket wallet when ready to go live\n- [ ] Build portfolio report (daily summary to Telegram)\n- [ ] Add to dashboard\n\n## Key Files\n- `src/monitor.js` — continuous whale scanner\n- `src/paper-trader.js` — simulated portfolio tracker\n- `src/scan-whales.js` — one-shot scanner with market overview\n- `data/whales.json` — tracked wallet addresses\n- `data/paper-portfolio.json` — current portfolio state\n- `ecosystem.config.cjs` — PM2 config for both processes\n---\nmonitor-state.json\npaper-portfolio.json\npaper-state.json\nwhales.json","cwd":"/home/ec2-user/clawd"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1769896902134}}
