{"type":"message","id":"192dc0c7","parentId":"4271e989","timestamp":"2026-01-31T22:03:46.556Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_014sw3Po9wkEQNq67QmutSnb","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade/STATE.md","content":"# Polymarket Bot — Current State\n\n**Last updated:** 2025-07-01\n\n## Architecture Pivot: Whale Copytrading → Arbitrage Detection\n\nOriginal system tracked whale wallets and paper-traded their positions. Now pivoted to **arbitrage detection** as the primary strategy, with whale monitoring kept as secondary.\n\n## What's Built\n\n### Primary: Arbitrage Detection System\n- **Arbitrage Scanner** (`src/arbitrage-scanner.js`, PM2: `polymarket-arbitrage`)\n  - Polls Gamma API for active markets every 10 seconds\n  - Fetches CLOB order books for each market\n  - Binary markets: checks if `best_ask_yes + best_ask_no < 0.95` (buy-both-sides arb)\n  - Also checks if `best_bid_yes + best_bid_no > 1.05` (sell-both-sides)\n  - Multi-outcome markets: checks if sum of all best asks < 0.95\n  - Logs opportunities to `data/arbitrage-opportunities.jsonl`\n  - High-value alerts ($5+) written to `data/alerts-pending.jsonl`\n\n- **Arbitrage Paper Trader** (`src/arbitrage-paper-trader.js`, PM2: `polymarket-arb-paper`)\n  - Reads opportunities file, simulates trades on $0.50+ profit opps\n  - Tracks P&L with 2% fee estimate\n  - Logs to `data/arbitrage-paper-trades.jsonl`\n  - State in `data/arbitrage-paper-state.json`\n\n### Secondary: Whale Monitoring (unchanged)\n- Whale monitor (`src/monitor.js`, PM2: `polymarket-monitor`)\n- Paper trader (`src/paper-trader.js`, PM2: `polymarket-paper`)\n- 9 whale wallets in `data/whales.json`\n\n## Key Files\n- `src/arbitrage-scanner.js` — main arbitrage detection loop\n- `src/arbitrage-paper-trader.js` — simulated arb trading\n- `src/monitor.js` — whale wallet scanner (secondary)\n- `src/paper-trader.js` — whale copy paper trader (secondary)\n- `data/arbitrage-opportunities.jsonl` — all detected arb opportunities\n- `data/arbitrage-paper-trades.jsonl` — simulated arb trades\n- `data/alerts-pending.jsonl` — high-value alerts for Telegram\n- `ecosystem.config.cjs` — PM2 config for all 4 processes\n\n## Next Steps\n- [ ] Monitor for a few days, see what opportunities appear\n- [ ] Tune thresholds (currently 5% buffer for fees)\n- [ ] Add WebSocket support for faster detection\n- [ ] Build Telegram alert integration (currently file-based)\n- [ ] Consider neg_risk markets for multi-outcome arbs\n- [ ] Dashboard integration\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":777,"cacheRead":21640,"cacheWrite":682,"totalTokens":23100,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.019425,"cacheRead":0.01082,"cacheWrite":0.0042625,"total":0.0345125}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769897011439}}
