{"type":"message","id":"a9c5d609","parentId":"3440500a","timestamp":"2026-01-31T22:08:47.289Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It's running and scanning. 0 opportunities found — which makes sense: Polymarket is an efficient market with many market makers, so arb opportunities with a 5% buffer are rare. The system is working correctly though — it's scanning 2000 markets every ~10 seconds.\n\nLet me verify the process is healthy and check if there are any near-misses by temporarily logging spreads:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01U75LaUw1NFDxf1id1Kq1an","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/polymarket-copytrade && node -e \"\nconst fetch = require('node-fetch');\n(async () => {\n  const g = await fetch('https://gamma-api.polymarket.com/markets?limit=10&active=true&closed=false');\n  const markets = await g.json();\n  for (const m of markets) {\n    if (!m.clobTokenIds) continue;\n    const ids = JSON.parse(m.clobTokenIds);\n    if (ids.length !== 2) continue;\n    const [b1, b2] = await Promise.all(ids.map(async id => {\n      const r = await fetch('https://clob.polymarket.com/book?token_id=' + id);\n      return r.json();\n    }));\n    const ask1 = b1.asks?.sort((a,b) => parseFloat(a.price) - parseFloat(b.price))[0];\n    const ask2 = b2.asks?.sort((a,b) => parseFloat(a.price) - parseFloat(b.price))[0];\n    if (ask1 && ask2) {\n      const spread = parseFloat(ask1.price) + parseFloat(ask2.price);\n      console.log(spread.toFixed(4), '|', m.question?.slice(0, 60));\n    }\n  }\n})();\n\" 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":502,"cacheRead":36535,"cacheWrite":934,"totalTokens":37972,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.01255,"cacheRead":0.0182675,"cacheWrite":0.005837500000000001,"total":0.03666}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769897317013}}
